  23:     Rule
  24:     - Count how many of the four grid corners are part of the five-pixel mask.
  25:     - Return the class label for that count: 0 corners -> 6, 1 -> 1,
  26:       2 -> 3, and 4 -> 2.
  27: 
  28:     Key insight
  29:     - Repeated masks with different colors produce the same output, so the
  30:       mask's color is irrelevant; only the occupied corner positions determine
  31:       the label.
