 23:     separation: blocks separated by 3-7 Manhattan distance
 24:   output_rule: |
 25:     Paint every bg pixel on any shortest 4-connected path between the two
 26:     endpoints (treating wall as impassable). Additionally, fill entire NxN
 27:     interior of any framed room that the shortest-path mask intersects.
 28:   path_metrics:
 29:     shortest_distance: 36-72
 30:     turns_on_single_path: 8-21
 31:     rooms_on_route: 6-14
